      },
      "message": "fix(ui): pin the toolbar version in tests so a version bump leaves the shell snapshots alone\n\nThe toolbar build badge pinned its build time and source sha under\ncfg(test) but still rendered the real CARGO_PKG_VERSION, so every\nrelease bump changed one glyph in the three shell snapshots. The badge\nnow reads a toolbar-only TOOLBAR_VERSION (\"0.0.0\" under test), through\ntoolbar_lines and the new toolbar_version() used by the narrow label in\npanes.rs. The debug-info dialog keeps the real version. Snapshots\nregenerated; only the badge (x 1224-1253, y 25-33) differs.\n\nFixes #449\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
